namespace Challenge;public record Item(string Id,DateTimeOffset CreatedAt);public static class Paginator{public static IReadOnlyList<Item> Page(IEnumerable<Item> items,DateTimeOffset? after,string? afterId,int take){if(take<=0)throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(take));return items.Where(x=>after is null||x.CreatedAt<after||(x.CreatedAt==after&&string.CompareOrdinal(x.Id,afterId)>0)).OrderByDescending(x=>x.CreatedAt).ThenBy(x=>x.Id,StringComparer.Ordinal).Take(take).ToList();}}
